00:03:27.570 --> 00:03:29.780
It's so cuuuuute!

00:03:29.780 --> 00:03:32.930
It's really got that unique charm of yours, President!

00:03:32.930 --> 00:03:35.890
Yeah! President, you have really good design sense!

00:03:35.890 --> 00:03:37.470
