00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:34.100
Th-They're so...

00:04:39.220 --> 00:04:40.740
They're all very cute!

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:41.510
Yup!

00:04:42.120 --> 00:04:44.680
Let's make the cutest clothes we can!

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:46.870
