But Satsuki's body was too weak, and he quickly fell ill. {Can we get this line on screen for a tiny bit longer? It's flashing away very fast, even for how fast I read.}

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:26.020
And that's why she did it?

00:07:26.020 --> 00:07:28.280
She wasn't put up to it by anyone, though.

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:29.380
If you please, then!

00:07:30.400 --> 00:07:36.430
She decided to take on her brother's role as successor to the School of Myoudouin so that she could protect him.

00:07:37.760 --> 00:07:41.060
Ever since she was five, when she started learning the martial arts.

00:07:41.780 --> 00:07:43.350
Give me one more try, please!

00:07:43.760 --> 00:07:45.460
That's just like her.

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:47.330
Yeah! My heart is aflame once more!

00:07:47.330 --> 00:07:49.850
A-As a friend, of course!

00:07:51.040 --> 00:07:53.670
I hope we'll be seeing a lot more of you in future.

00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:54.530
Right!

00:07:57.160 --> 00:08:01.300
Finally... finally, it is within my grasp!

00:08:02.180 --> 00:08:04.080
That's quite the ruckus you're making there, Kumojacky.

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:05.880
Oh, Professor Sabark!

00:08:06.160 --> 00:08:08.330
This time I'm going to pulverize them for good!

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:11.570
With the Big Bang Kumojacky Special!

00:08:13.010 --> 00:08:13.090
Whaaat?!

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:13.260
Whaaat?!

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:14.510
Whaaat?!

00:08:14.890 --> 00:08:17.730
You don't want to make the clothes anymore?

00:08:17.730 --> 00:08:22.270
I'm sorry. I realized that I'm really not suited for that kind of thing. {Removed 'just' before 'realized' - not necessary.}

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:23.310
"Not suited"?

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:25.730
Th-That's right.

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:27.590
Was it not fun for you?

00:08:27.590 --> 00:08:29.200
F-Fun?

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:32.090
It's just that I have other things I need to be doing, so...

00:08:33.980 --> 00:08:37.370
Well then, we'll finish it by ourselves, so you can just sit back and watch!

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:38.280
What?

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:39.810
Let's go, Tsubomi!

00:08:39.810 --> 00:08:41.160
Hey, wait!

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:44.990
After making the patterns, we have to trim the material!

00:08:44.990 --> 00:08:46.560
We only have one chance!

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:49.550
Focus your spirit and seize victory with one stroke!

00:08:53.980 --> 00:08:57.680
For a moment there, the atmosphere got tense, just like in a martial arts bout.

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:00.480
Making clothing is just as serious a battle! {Added 'of.'}{NOT ON MY WATCH}

00:09:00.480 --> 00:09:01.470
I see...

00:09:03.260 --> 00:09:04.640
Next, we sew it all together!

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:06.850
I can handle that if you want!

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:17.360
Do you want to try?

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:18.570
Huh?

00:09:18.570 --> 00:09:19.380
Here you go!

00:09:20.020 --> 00:09:20.830
Is it really okay?

00:09:22.400 --> 00:09:23.290
Of course!

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:41.890
It's finally finished!

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:44.320
The tunic I designed...

00:09:44.320 --> 00:09:46.390
Hurry up and try it on!

00:09:46.390 --> 00:09:47.820
Try it on...

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:49.110
What?!

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:54.210
Th-This is me?

00:09:54.210 --> 00:09:55.270
Whaddya think?

00:09:55.270 --> 00:09:56.410
You look lovely!

00:09:57.400 --> 00:09:58.980
No way! I don't!

00:09:58.980 --> 00:10:00.570
It really suits you.

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:02.550
Brother!

00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:05.370
So that's what the real you looks like.

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:08.420
Stop that, will you?!

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:09.950
I'm just playing around, all right?!

00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:10.670
I don't...

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:11.840
Itsuki...

00:10:12.510 --> 00:10:13.370
We've got trouble!

00:10:14.430 --> 00:10:16.170
We've got a challenger!

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:17.870
Itsuki!

00:10:18.660 --> 00:10:20.090
You mustn't go!

00:10:20.450 --> 00:10:23.000
Don't worry yourself over me!

00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:26.090
I will protect the School of Myoudouin!

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:44.410
Been a while, ain't it?

00:10:44.860 --> 00:10:48.080
I've come for yer school's nameplate, old man!

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:49.460
Well, if it isn't Hiroto.

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:54.040
Oh. So yer kind enough to remember the guy ya ostracized, huh?

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:58.360
The School of Myoudouin has no need of those so concerned with victory

00:10:58.360 --> 00:11:00.630
as to abandon all decency to obtain it.

00:11:01.400 --> 00:11:03.970
All that matters in battle is winning!

00:11:04.240 --> 00:11:06.100
If ya disagree, then face me!

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:07.430
Grandfather.

00:11:07.740 --> 00:11:09.110
I will face him in your stead.

00:11:09.110 --> 00:11:09.890
Huh?

00:11:09.890 --> 00:11:13.730
