00:11:10.570 --> 00:11:12.130
Don'tcha get it, kid?

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:13.730
Yer sign's at stake if ya lose!

00:11:14.220 --> 00:11:16.730
I too bear the name of Myoudouin.

00:11:17.340 --> 00:11:20.570
I'll show you just how much your 
deficiency in training will cost you.

00:11:21.190 --> 00:11:21.910
Very well then.

00:11:22.330 --> 00:11:23.750
I leave this to you, Itsuki.

00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:24.370
Sir!

00:11:29.400 --> 00:11:30.030
Bow!

00:11:31.530 --> 00:11:32.460
Begin!

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:38.550
Are ya just gonna keep runnin'?!

00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:48.850
Are you all right?

00:11:51.710 --> 00:11:52.520
This is in the bag!

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:53.690
Cease!

00:11:54.840 --> 00:11:56.590
This fight has reached its conclusion.

00:11:56.590 --> 00:11:58.280
Th-That was cheap!

00:11:58.280 --> 00:12:00.060
A loss is a loss, I think you'll find.

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:01.450
It is as Hiroto says.

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:02.770
Huh?!

00:12:02.770 --> 00:12:06.600
Were this bout to the death, then you would have lost your life.

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:10.290
Well then, I'll be takin' yer nameplate, 'kay?

00:12:11.360 --> 00:12:12.950
Do as you wish.

00:12:14.200 --> 00:12:18.330
Was that really all this nameplate meant to ya, huh?

00:12:20.980 --> 00:12:22.560
I'm sorry!

00:12:22.560 --> 00:12:25.590
I've damaged the proud name of Myoudouin!

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:27.630
Itsuki.

00:12:27.630 --> 00:12:28.470
Yes?

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:30.480
For a while, you will cease your training.

00:12:30.480 --> 00:12:31.300
Huh?

00:12:31.300 --> 00:12:33.310
I feel you have reached your limit.

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:37.520
The purpose behind martial arts is to 
become master of your own existence.

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:40.900
It is not something you do for brother or family. {Nor -> or. Pretty sure that's the correct one to use here.}

00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:44.610
Do not worry yourself with the future of the School.

00:12:45.220 --> 00:12:48.740
What is truly important is that you follow your own heart.

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:50.720
Follow my heart?

00:12:53.380 --> 00:12:54.350
Grandfather!

00:12:55.150 --> 00:12:56.310
Grandfather!

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:01.350
Itsuki.

00:13:03.100 --> 00:13:04.050
Brother...

00:13:04.770 --> 00:13:06.740
It's just as Grandfather says, you know?

00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:10.510
What's important is what's in your heart.

00:13:11.430 --> 00:13:17.110
We're all very grateful that you've worked so hard, both for my sake and everyone else's. {Added comma after 'hard'}

00:13:18.180 --> 00:13:19.610
But from now on,

00:13:20.070 --> 00:13:26.610
you should walk your own path—the one you wish to walk—not the one you feel you must.

00:13:27.630 --> 00:13:30.570
That's what we all wish for.

00:13:32.390 --> 00:13:33.570
Master!

00:13:34.280 --> 00:13:35.720
Why didn't you defeat me?!

00:13:35.720 --> 00:13:37.780
Why didn't you tell me what it is I've been doing wrong?!

00:13:37.780 --> 00:13:39.590
I really just want...

00:13:41.950 --> 00:13:45.930
I am a Commander of the Desert Apostles... Kumojacky!

00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:50.970
The Flower of your Heart yearns to wilt, so I shall steal it from you!

00:13:51.770 --> 00:13:54.980
Flower of the Heart, show yourself!

00:14:01.620 --> 00:14:05.260
You're up, Desertrian!

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:11.430
Nameplate! Nameplate!

00:14:11.430 --> 00:14:13.910
This is baaaaad!

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:20.150
I had convinced myself that inheriting the School of Myoudouin

00:14:20.150 --> 00:14:22.210
would've been the best way to protect my brother.

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:26.950
But without my martial arts, 
what purpose do I really have?

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:29.480
I dedicated everything to learning the martial arts.

00:14:29.480 --> 00:14:31.600
I don't have a path of my own to walk. {my all -> everything}

00:14:31.880 --> 00:14:33.220
You have plenty!

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:34.060
Huh?

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:35.860
Yeah!

00:14:35.860 --> 00:14:39.100
You can become a fashion 
designer or whatever you want!

00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:41.770
Become a fashion designer? {lol english}

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:42.920
Yeah!

00:14:42.920 --> 00:14:46.130
Just do the things you enjoy and have fun!

00:14:46.130 --> 00:14:48.070
You just have to be honest with your heart!

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:49.780
Honest with my heart...

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:51.870
Nameplaaaaaaate!

00:14:52.370 --> 00:14:53.460
What is that thing?

00:14:53.460 --> 00:14:54.910
Hurry and run, you two!

00:14:55.440 --> 00:14:56.260
Tsubomi!

00:14:56.260 --> 00:14:57.330
Erika!

00:14:57.670 --> 00:15:00.670
I just wanted to return to the dojo!

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:04.340
The truth is that I always loved the School of Myoudouin!

00:15:05.440 --> 00:15:06.920
Is that Hiroto?!

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:08.720
Transform!

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:22.400
Go, Seeds of the Precure!

00:15:25.550 --> 00:15:26.760
Precure!

00:15:26.760 --> 00:15:28.360
Open My Heart!

00:16:13.160 --> 00:16:16.140
A lone flower, blooming from the earth!

00:16:19.530 --> 00:16:21.330
Cure Blossom!

00:16:23.860 --> 00:16:26.960
A lone flower, swaying in the sea breeze!

00:16:29.860 --> 00:16:31.330
Cure Marine!

00:16:35.870 --> 00:16:38.740
HeartCatch Precure!

00:16:45.330 --> 00:16:46.780
It's dangerous here!

00:16:46.780 --> 00:16:47.990
Hurry and run!

00:16:48.660 --> 00:16:50.040
Precures...

00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:51.480
You're so cute!

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:52.860
Run already!

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:54.990
Masteeeeeeeer!

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:02.220
What a baby this one is!

00:17:02.220 --> 00:17:04.790
Wanting his Master to scold him so!

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:08.750
You're just abusing that dojo challenger's heart that yearned to apologize!

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:12.090
And I've had it up to here with this!

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:16.470
My heart may be vaster than the sea, but this is as much as it can take!

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:27.810
Gather, Floral Power!

00:17:29.300 --> 00:17:31.530
Blossom Tact!

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:35.110
Marine Tact!

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:37.240
I shall not allow it!

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:40.990
Big Bang Kumojacky Special!

00:17:54.950 --> 00:17:56.590
Worry not. It shall be swift. {TWO FUCKING FINGERS}

00:17:57.880 --> 00:17:58.820
Now, fall!

00:17:58.820 --> 00:17:59.530
I won't let you!

00:18:00.520 --> 00:18:01.430
Quickly!

00:18:01.430 --> 00:18:02.680
Behind you!

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:04.270
Run!

00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:08.400
Nameplate-ate-ate!

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:17.490
Nameplate! Plate! Plate!

00:18:16.680 --> 00:18:17.490
Precures!

00:18:17.490 --> 00:18:18.810
Where do you think you're looking?!

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:23.540
Oh? Not bad for a mere human.

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:25.000
I suppose I can play with you for a while.

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:31.730
<i>Walking the path of the martial artist has
 been filled with one hardship after another.</i>

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:35.590
<i>But at the same time, refining my skill in the arts gave me great pleasure.</i>

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:41.090
School of
Myoudouin

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:40.450
<i>It's not like I trained merely for my family's sake, or for my brother's,</i>

00:18:41.090 --> 00:18:43.560
<i>but because I loved the martial arts too!</i>

00:18:44.260 --> 00:18:48.310
<i>I can use this power to protect the ones I love! {Removed an extra 'the.'}</i>

00:18:48.810 --> 00:18:50.270
Here I come!

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:55.200
How's that?!

00:18:55.910 --> 00:18:57.780
Was that meant to do anything?

00:19:01.070 --> 00:19:02.200
Precure!

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:03.370
Thank you!

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:07.620
But leave the rest to us Precures, okay?!

00:19:13.470 --> 00:19:14.210
Let's finish this!

00:19:18.850 --> 00:19:22.260
Gather, Dual Floral Power!

00:19:22.720 --> 00:19:27.870
Precure Floral Power Fortissimo!

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:40.550
Heart Catch!

00:19:55.760 --> 00:19:56.750
Hmph!

00:19:56.750 --> 00:19:59.260
So it seems you have become a little stronger after all.

00:19:59.260 --> 00:20:02.760
Next time, you had better entertain me even more!

00:20:11.220 --> 00:20:13.100
Now, be brave,

00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:15.520
and be honest with your heart.

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:18.080
Master!

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:20.700
I'm sorry!

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:24.950
I always wanted to apologize to you for the underhanded techniques I used!

00:20:24.950 --> 00:20:28.300
So I'm begging you! Please accept me back into the School of Myoudouin!

00:20:31.910 --> 00:20:32.660
Hiroto.

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:33.580
Yes?!

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:37.640
Do you know the reason why I banished you?

00:20:37.640 --> 00:20:40.420
Because I used underhanded moves.

00:20:40.420 --> 00:20:41.920
That's not all it was.

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:47.010
It was because you betrayed your heart that loved the martial arts so dearly.

00:20:48.740 --> 00:20:53.130
If you can now be earnest with your heart,

00:20:53.130 --> 00:20:56.470
and truly wish to learn under the School of Myoudouin,

00:20:56.470 --> 00:20:59.060
then you may do as you will.

00:20:59.060 --> 00:21:00.410
Thank you very much, sir!

00:21:01.550 --> 00:21:03.780
In the language of flowers, a violet means "humility."

00:21:04.350 --> 00:21:07.120
It really is important to be honest-hearted, isn't it?

00:21:09.290 --> 00:21:12.160
I think a Heart Seed's about to be born.

00:21:23.090 --> 00:21:27.060
With this, the Great Heart Tree has recovered a little more!

00:21:29.650 --> 00:21:31.070
Oh, that's right!

00:21:32.070 --> 00:21:33.850
I have a favor to ask of you both.

00:21:34.500 --> 00:21:36.560
Would you allow me to join the Fashion Club?

00:21:37.820 --> 00:21:38.800
That'd be great!

00:21:38.800 --> 00:21:40.520
You're more than welcome!

00:21:42.970 --> 00:21:47.590
Grandfather, Mother, and you too, Brother...

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:50.060
The worries that plagued me have passed,

00:21:50.780 --> 00:21:52.980
and I can now show you the truth in my heart.

00:21:53.950 --> 00:21:58.040
I love both martial arts and cute clothes!

00:22:09.970 --> 00:22:10.000
{ED}

00:22:17.640 --> 00:22:18.810
HeartCatch!

00:22:20.560 --> 00:22:21.730
HeartCatch!

00:22:23.480 --> 00:22:24.650
HeartCatch!

00:22:24.940 --> 00:22:27.610
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:33.660 --> 00:22:36.200
The flower blooms with an "Open sesame!"

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:39.170
In the wardrobe of my heart

00:22:39.710 --> 00:22:42.290
are all the things that a girl loves

00:22:42.630 --> 00:22:44.790
Look, they're packed in so tight

00:22:45.340 --> 00:22:48.170
My makeover was a huge success

00:22:48.470 --> 00:22:50.760
thanks to this scrunchie and this frilly tunic!

00:22:51.470 --> 00:22:53.760
Our girly showtime

00:22:54.140 --> 00:22:56.600
is about to begin!

00:22:57.100 --> 00:22:59.810
Is my coordination lookin' good today?

00:22:59.930 --> 00:23:02.730
Shuffle! Colorful! Beautiful!

00:23:02.980 --> 00:23:05.650
Mismatches are just part of my character v(^^)v

00:23:05.900 --> 00:23:07.190
We're pretty

00:23:07.360 --> 00:23:08.990
at full bloom!

00:23:09.650 --> 00:23:12.110
If you polish your heart

00:23:12.530 --> 00:23:15.160
until it shines

00:23:15.490 --> 00:23:16.700
Then even the darkness

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:20.950
will become a guiding light

00:23:21.330 --> 00:23:23.960
So don't sulk

00:23:24.170 --> 00:23:26.880
because a smile's the best!

00:23:27.010 --> 00:23:30.340
Let's make them bloom, facing the sun

00:23:30.420 --> 00:23:33.550
The flowers of our hearts

00:23:35.180 --> 00:23:36.430
HeartCatch!

00:23:36.600 --> 00:23:39.850
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:42.770 --> 00:23:44.730
<i>The fires of youth, and the conflicts that arise from them!</i>

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:47.190
<i>The fastest embroiderer in the West...</i>

00:23:47.190 --> 00:23:48.780
<i>Kurumi Erika of the Fashion Club!</i>

00:23:49.110 --> 00:23:51.110
<i>And the most talented of performers...</i>

00:23:51.110 --> 00:23:53.030
<i>Takagishi Azusa of the Drama Club!</i>

00:23:53.030 --> 00:23:57.830
<i>Will their burning spirits be able to set their friends' hearts ablaze?!</i>

00:23:57.830 --> 00:24:00.080
<i>Will these two brave club leaders live to see another dawn?!</i>

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:02.710
HeartCatch Precure<i>:</i>

00:24:02.710 --> 00:24:06.130
Erika is Her Rival<i>!</i>

00:24:02.710 --> 00:24:06.130
Erika is Her Rival<i>!</i>

00:24:06.600 --> 00:24:08.550
<i>We'll catch everyone's hearts!</i>
